## Key Concepts
- End-to-end data validation across landing areas and warehouse
- Idempotent MERGE/upsert semantics ensuring data consistency
- Late data and backfill handling with drift detection mechanisms
- Traffic simulation and CI-backed regression testing
- Schema evolution compatibility validation
- Data reconciliation and consistency checks

## Code Example
